"""Bilingual explanation of the ACORD correction, with no retrieved text examples."""
import json

def render(root,a,c,page,tab,lang,name):
 t=lambda z,e:e if lang else z
 pre='../' if lang else ''
 b='<section class="phase-hero"><p class="eyebrow">ACORD / LEGAL RETRIEVAL</p><h1>'+t('法律條款搜尋，為什麼更需要仔細評估？','Why does legal-clause retrieval need closer evaluation?')+'</h1><p class="lead">'+t('找得到相似條款，不等於找到符合需求的高品質條款。這裡分開呈現最新修正成績、公開研究與目前的限制。','A similar clause is not necessarily a high-quality clause that meets the need. This page separates corrected results, published research and current limitations.')+'</p></section>'
 b+='<section><h2>'+t('七個純 Embedder 的修正結果','Corrected results for seven standalone embedders')+'</h2><p>'+t('57題、3,931條款。由原始完整向量還原排名，評分前排除未標註配對；nDCG採線性分級，Top-1、MRR與Recall以3星以上為相關。未重新執行模型。重排器的修正結果待補測，因此不混入此表或首頁平均。','57 queries and 3,931 clauses. Full rankings are reconstructed from original vectors, excluding unjudged pairs before scoring. nDCG uses linear grades; Top-1, MRR and Recall require at least 3 stars. No models were rerun. Corrected reranker results await measurement and are excluded from this table and the homepage mean.')+'</p>'
 b+=tab(['Embedder','nDCG@10','Top-1',t('4星以上 P@5','4+ star P@5'),t('5星 P@5','5-star P@5')],[[f'<a href="models/{r["embedding"]}.html">{name(r["embedding"])}</a>',f'{r["ndcg10"]:.3f}',f'{r["top1"]*100:.2f}%',f'{r["p5_stars4"]*100:.2f}%',f'{r["p5_stars5"]*100:.2f}%'] for r in c['rows']])
 b+='<p class="small">'+t('P@5依原論文以min(5,符合星等的條款數)正規化；沒有該星等條款的題目不納入該指標平均。5星指標可評題數為','Following the paper, star P@5 divides by min(5, number of qualifying clauses); queries with none are excluded for that metric. The 5-star metric includes ')+str(c['rows'][0]['p5_stars5_evaluable_queries'])+t('題。排名相同時以文件ID排序。修正後效能未重新量測，故不沿用舊時間。',' queries. Score ties use document IDs. Corrected-protocol latency was not remeasured, so old timings are not reused.')+'</p></section>'
 b+='<section id="published"><h2>'+t('法律任務確實有難點，但不是所有公開成績都低','Legal retrieval is challenging, but published scores are not uniformly low')+'</h2><p>'+t('本次純Embedder的ACORD nDCG為0.52–0.70，數值低於多數百科分項；不同題目、語料與標註方式，不能把差距全當成法律領域的因果效果。','Local standalone ACORD nDCG ranges from 0.52 to 0.70, numerically below most encyclopedia conditions. Different questions, corpora and judgments prevent attributing the entire gap to the legal domain.')+'</p><p>'+t('ACORD原論文中，BM25的nDCG@10為0.540，MiniLM＋GPT-4o為0.812；後者5星P@5仍只有17.2%。這支持「高品質條款難排前面」，不支持「ACORD普遍只有0.1–0.2」。模型、候選數與實作不同，不能直接判定本站勝過或落後原論文。','The ACORD paper reports nDCG@10 of 0.540 for BM25 and 0.812 for MiniLM + GPT-4o; the latter still has 5-star P@5 of only 17.2%. This supports difficulty ranking high-quality clauses, not uniformly tiny ACORD scores. Different models, candidate counts and implementations prevent claims of beating or trailing the paper.')+' <a href="https://aclanthology.org/2025.acl-long.1206.pdf">ACORD · Table D-3</a></p><p>'+t('另一項LegalBench-RAG測試中，text-embedding-3-large、500字元切塊、不加重排器的MAUD Recall@32為18.36%，CUAD為64.38%。OpenContracts另一次實測分別為18.48%與64.78%。可見部分法律任務在不同實測都偏難，但這是答案文字範圍的召回率，不能與本站nDCG或回答正確率混比。','In LegalBench-RAG, text-embedding-3-large with 500-character chunks and no reranking achieves Recall@32 of 18.36% on MAUD and 64.38% on CUAD. OpenContracts reports 18.48% and 64.78%, respectively. Some legal tasks remain difficult across implementations, but these are answer-span recall metrics, not nDCG or generated-answer accuracy.')+' <a href="https://arxiv.org/html/2408.10343v1">LegalBench-RAG · Table 4</a> · <a href="https://open-source-legal.github.io/OpenContracts/benchmarks/legalbench_rag_results/">OpenContracts</a></p></section>'
 b+='<section id="correction"><h2>'+t('為什麼需要修正？','Why was a correction needed?')+'</h2><p>'+t('ACORD要求忽略未知評分的配對；舊程式卻將未標註文件視為零gain，仍占用排名位置，另使用指數gain。純Embedder完整向量仍在，因此能還原所有排名；399份原始前50名與原結果全部吻合，七組向量檔也通過原manifest雜湊檢查。這是計分規則修正，不是模型突然變好。','ACORD requires ignoring pairs with unknown judgments. The old code assigned unjudged documents zero gain while retaining rank positions, and used exponential gain. Complete standalone vectors allow full rankings to be recovered: all 399 saved Top50 lists match, and all seven caches pass their original manifest hashes. This corrects evaluation rules; it is not a sudden model improvement.')+' <a href="https://aclanthology.org/2025.acl-long.1206.pdf">ACORD · C.5 / F.1</a></p><p>'+t('重排器只替舊的50篇候選打分。移除未知文件後候選不足，無法補出其他文章的重排分數。要發布同規則的重排比較，必須重新選足有效候選並補跑重排；這一頁沒有用診斷值冒充正式成績。','Rerankers scored only the old 50 candidates. Removing unjudged documents leaves insufficient candidates and cannot supply missing reranker scores. Comparable corrected reranking requires a new candidate pool and reranking. Diagnostic values below are not corrected official results.')+'</p></section>'
 diag=json.loads((root/'data/matrix/acord-diagnostic.json').read_text('utf-8'))['results']
 b+='<section><details><summary>'+t('檢閱舊候選池的診斷重算（不列排名）','Inspect old-pool diagnostics (excluded from rankings)')+'</summary><p>'+t('僅對已保存的50篇結果排除未標註文件並改用線性gain；缺少更後面的文章，不能直接對照完整排名。以下三欄同時展示原值、診斷值與候選標註覆蓋，避免只挑較高的數字。','These diagnostics remove unjudged entries from the saved 50 and use linear gain. Missing deeper documents prevent comparison with full rankings. Original scores, diagnostics and judgment coverage are shown together to avoid selecting only higher numbers.')+'</p>'
 b+=tab([t('組合','Setup'),t('舊指數nDCG','Old exp. nDCG'),t('截斷池線性nDCG（診斷）','Truncated-pool linear nDCG (diagnostic)'),t('標註覆蓋@50','Judged @50')],[[name(r['embedding'])+' + '+name(r['reranker']),f'{r["original_exp_ndcg"]:.3f}',f'{r["condensed_saved50_linear_ndcg"]:.3f}',f'{r["judged_fraction50"]*100:.2f}%'] for r in diag])+'</details></section>'
 b+='<section id="downloads"><h2>'+t('檢查與重現','Inspect and reproduce')+'</h2><p>'+t('下載完整399份已標註排名與逐題成績，使用離線驗證器重算。原始向量不隨附；若已有本機快取，可用recompute_acord.py重新還原。首頁五項平均另由原始逐題結果核對，原始ZIP不覆寫。','Download all 399 complete judged rankings and per-query scores and recalculate them with the offline verifier. Vectors are not redistributed; existing local caches can be replayed with recompute_acord.py. The five-task mean is checked against original records; original ZIPs are preserved.')+'</p><p><a href="'+pre+'downloads/acord-corrected-rankings.zip">'+t('完整修正排名ZIP','Complete corrected rankings ZIP')+'</a> · <a href="'+pre+'data/matrix/acord-corrected.json">'+t('修正摘要與來源雜湊','Corrected summary and source hashes')+'</a> · <a href="'+pre+'scripts/recompute_acord.py">'+t('向量重算程式','Vector replay code')+'</a> · <a href="'+pre+'scripts/verify_correction.py">'+t('離線驗證器','Offline verifier')+'</a></p><p><code>python scripts/verify_correction.py</code></p><p>ACORD: The Atticus Project and authors · CC BY 4.0 · <a href="latest-methods.html#license">'+t('完整授權與原始下載','Licenses and original downloads')+'</a></p></section>'
 return page('acord.html',t('ACORD法律檢索：修正結果與研究對照','ACORD legal retrieval: corrected results and research'),b,lang)
